# Feature Request: FR-456

**Title:** Add support for Spanish language
**Submitted by:** Customer Success Team
**Date:** January 10, 2026
**Priority:** High

## Description

Several of our customers have requested support for the Spanish language in the MedSync Platform. This would allow them to better serve their Spanish-speaking patients and care teams.

## Business Value

- Expand our addressable market to include hospitals serving large Spanish-speaking populations.
- Improve customer satisfaction and retention.

## Proposed Solution

- Translate the entire user interface into Spanish.
- Provide Spanish-language documentation and support materials.

## Status

Under review by the Product team.
